{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"3876aa34","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.003655,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:34.344873+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:34.341218+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# 作业二：卷积 VAE 三阶段优化与诊断（Kaggle 完整版）\n","\n","本 Notebook 严格按照本次讨论的三个优先级执行：\n","1. **不改变 VAE 的诊断**：使用冻结的辅助分类器，测量 4 / 7 / 8 等数字在重建后的类别混淆，画出全部类别混淆矩阵与关键示例。\n","2. **潜变量维度对照**：固定卷积结构、MSE、β、轮次、随机种子，将 z=4 与 z=8 比较。\n","3. **边缘损失实验**：固定 z=4，以原始 Conv+MSE 为对照，加入 Sobel 边缘差异损失。\n","\n","所有 VAE 依旧是**无监督**训练；MNIST 标签只在训练辅助分类器以及评估时使用，不参与 VAE 训练。冻结分类器可能对模糊或生成图片误判，故其输出是辅助指标，不能代替重建 MSE 和人工观察。\n","\n","**重要**：由于边缘损失会改变训练目标，即使 β 数值一致，也不能直接比较跨目标的训练总损失；统一用验证集 MSE、真实图像的重建类别一致率、方向性混淆以及先验采样图比较。\n","\n","## Kaggle 使用说明\n","- 挂载原先的 MNIST 数据集 `CNNmodel_database_MNIST`；以下 IDX 路径与之前代码一致。\n","- **可选**：把上一轮 `conv_mse`、`conv_bce` 的 40 轮 `.pt` 和 `reference_classifier.pt` 上传为 Kaggle Dataset，或者保留在以前 Notebook 的 Output 中并添加为 Input。代码会依文件内部 `config.name` 来识别，不根据文件名猜模型。\n","- 如果找不到旧文件，代码会**从第1轮训练** `conv_mse_z4` 和辅助分类器。新实验 `conv_mse_z8`、`conv_mse_edge_z4` 必须重新训练。\n","- 一键运行全部单元格；全部结果保存在 `hw2_results/vae_three_stage_v1`，与之前目录相互独立。\n","- 默认不触碰保留测试集；本次全部用于验证集诊断，最终确定配置后再独立评估测试集。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"90a80485","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-02T15:46:34.351534Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-02T15:46:34.351172Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.209039Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.208196Z"},"papermill":{"duration":5.863324,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.210803+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:34.347479+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["device= cuda FAST_DEV_RUN= False DATA_ROOT= /kaggle/input/datasets/yuesun0502/cnnmodel-database-minist output= /kaggle/working/hw2_results/vae_three_stage_v1\n"]}],"source":["from pathlib import Path\n","import os, random, struct, json, csv, gc, zipfile, shutil, math, copy\n","import numpy as np\n","import torch\n","from torch import nn\n","import torch.nn.functional as F\n","from torch.utils.data import Dataset, DataLoader, Subset\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","\n","FAST_DEV_RUN = os.getenv('VAE_FAST_DEV_RUN', '0') == '1'  # 正式 Kaggle 请保持 False\n","DATA_ROOT = Path(os.getenv('VAE_IDX_ROOT', '/kaggle/input/datasets/yuesun0502/cnnmodel-database-minist'))\n","WORK = Path(os.getenv('VAE_OUTPUT_ROOT', '/kaggle/working' if Path('/kaggle/working').is_dir() else str(Path.cwd())))\n","ROOT = WORK / 'hw2_results' / ('vae_three_stage_smoke' if FAST_DEV_RUN else 'vae_three_stage_v1')\n","MODELS, TABLES, FIGS = [ROOT / x for x in ('models', 'tables', 'figures')]\n","for d in (MODELS, TABLES, FIGS): d.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","\n","SEED = 42\n","BETA = 0.0005\n","LR = 1e-4\n","BATCH_SIZE = 256\n","EPOCHS = 40\n","VAL_COUNT = 5000\n","CLASSIFIER_EPOCHS = 3\n","EDGE_WEIGHT = 0.10             # 在与像素 MSE 同为“按元素平均”的尺度下先做一次 0.10 对照\n","SAMPLED_REPEATS = 3\n","PRIOR_EVAL_N = 2000\n","PRIOR_SHOW_N = 64\n","REUSE_PRIOR_WEIGHTS = True      # 允许复用已核验配置的旧 40 轮卷积模型\n","RUN_FULL = True                 # False 时仅加载现有权重做诊断，无检查点则报错\n","FINAL_TEST_CONFIRMED = False    # 选定模型以前不使用测试集调参\n","FINAL_RUN = 'conv_mse_edge_z4'  # 只有 FINAL_TEST_CONFIRMED=True 时才会被使用\n","if FAST_DEV_RUN:\n","    EPOCHS = 1; BATCH_SIZE = 16; VAL_COUNT = 20\n","    CLASSIFIER_EPOCHS = 1; PRIOR_EVAL_N = 32; PRIOR_SHOW_N = 16\n","    SAMPLED_REPEATS = 1; TRAIN_CONV_BCE_IF_ABSENT = False\n","    torch.set_num_threads(min(torch.get_num_threads(), 2))\n","\n","device = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n","\n","def seed_all(seed):\n","    random.seed(seed); np.random.seed(seed); torch.manual_seed(seed)\n","    if torch.cuda.is_available(): torch.cuda.manual_seed_all(seed)\n","\n","seed_all(SEED)\n","print('device=',device,'FAST_DEV_RUN=',FAST_DEV_RUN,'DATA_ROOT=',DATA_ROOT,'output=',ROOT)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"638e275d","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002617,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.216202+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.213585+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 1. 直接读取 Kaggle MNIST IDX，固定训练和验证划分\n","划分方法沿用前一次实验的 `torch.Generator().manual_seed(2026)`，使训练集 55,000、验证集 5,000 的索引一致；模型评估严格使用相同样本。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"id":"34577ad8","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.223009Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.222396Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.770053Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.769186Z"},"papermill":{"duration":3.553112,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.77191+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:40.218798+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["train= 55000 val= 5000 test withheld= 10000\n"]}],"source":["IDX = {\n"," 'train_images': DATA_ROOT/'train-images-idx3-ubyte'/'train-images.idx3-ubyte',\n"," 'train_labels': DATA_ROOT/'train-labels-idx1-ubyte'/'train-labels.idx1-ubyte',\n"," 'test_images':  DATA_ROOT/'t10k-images-idx3-ubyte'/'t10k-images.idx3-ubyte',\n"," 'test_labels':  DATA_ROOT/'t10k-labels-idx1-ubyte'/'t10k-labels.idx1-ubyte'\n","}\n","missing=[str(p) for p in IDX.values() if not p.is_file()]\n","if missing: raise FileNotFoundError('没有找到以前 Kaggle 数据集的 IDX 文件：\\n'+'\\n'.join(missing)+'\\n请先在 Kaggle Add Input 中挂载相同 MNIST Dataset，或修改 DATA_ROOT。')\n","\n","def read_idx_images(path):\n","    with path.open('rb') as f:\n","        magic,n,h,w=struct.unpack('>IIII',f.read(16))\n","        a=np.frombuffer(f.read(), dtype=np.uint8).copy()\n","    if (magic,h,w)!=(2051,28,28) or len(a)!=n*h*w: raise ValueError('IDX 图片文件无效 '+str(path))\n","    return torch.from_numpy(a.reshape(n,1,28,28))\n","\n","def read_idx_labels(path):\n","    with path.open('rb') as f:\n","        magic,n=struct.unpack('>II',f.read(8))\n","        a=np.frombuffer(f.read(), dtype=np.uint8).copy()\n","    if magic!=2049 or len(a)!=n: raise ValueError('IDX 标签文件无效 '+str(path))\n","    return torch.from_numpy(a).long()\n","\n","class IDXMNIST(Dataset):\n","    def __init__(self, split, limit=None):\n","        self.images=read_idx_images(IDX[f'{split}_images'])\n","        self.labels=read_idx_labels(IDX[f'{split}_labels'])\n","        assert len(self.images)==len(self.labels)\n","        if limit is not None:\n","            self.images=self.images[:limit]; self.labels=self.labels[:limit]\n","    def __len__(self): return len(self.labels)\n","    def __getitem__(self,i): return self.images[i].float()/255., self.labels[i]\n","\n","full=IDXMNIST('train',limit=96 if FAST_DEV_RUN else None)\n","# 测试集单独读取但在最终确认前绝不评价；模拟数据只用于流程检查。\n","test=IDXMNIST('test',limit=48 if FAST_DEV_RUN else None)\n","val_n=min(VAL_COUNT,len(full)//4)\n","perm=torch.randperm(len(full),generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(2026))\n","train_ids=perm[:-val_n].tolist(); val_ids=perm[-val_n:].tolist()\n","train_set=Subset(full,train_ids); val_set=Subset(full,val_ids)\n","np.savez_compressed(TABLES/'split_indices.npz',train_idx=train_ids,val_idx=val_ids)\n","val_loader=DataLoader(val_set,batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,shuffle=False,num_workers=0)\n","test_loader=DataLoader(test,batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,shuffle=False,num_workers=0)\n","\n","def make_train_loader(epoch,seed=SEED):\n","    gen=torch.Generator().manual_seed(seed*10000+epoch)\n","    return DataLoader(train_set,batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,shuffle=True,generator=gen,num_workers=0)\n","\n","print('train=',len(train_set),'val=',len(val_set),'test withheld=',len(test))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"fe4c12b8","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002571,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.777372+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.774801+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 2. 与已有 `conv_mse` 完全一致的卷积 VAE、辅助分类器和 Sobel 边缘项\n","Sobel 梯度不是二值化后处理：它是**训练时的一个可微正则项**。我们在同一验证集上单独记录像素 MSE 与边缘误差，从而避免仅凭看起来锐利就认定有优化。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":3,"id":"a3eccd11","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.785273Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.78481Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.545729Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.544891Z"},"papermill":{"duration":1.767307,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.547667+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:43.78036+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["conv_mse_z4 parameters 874441\n","conv_mse_z8 parameters 875985\n","conv_mse_edge_z4 parameters 874441\n"]}],"source":["class ConvVAE(nn.Module):\n","    def __init__(self,d=4):\n","        super().__init__(); self.d=d\n","        self.features=nn.Sequential(\n","            nn.Conv2d(1,32,4,2,1),nn.ReLU(),\n","            nn.Conv2d(32,64,4,2,1),nn.ReLU(),\n","            nn.Flatten(),nn.Linear(64*7*7,128),nn.ReLU())\n","        self.mu=nn.Linear(128,d); self.lv=nn.Linear(128,d)\n","        self.up=nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(d,128),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(128,64*7*7),nn.ReLU())\n","        self.deconv=nn.Sequential(nn.ConvTranspose2d(64,32,4,2,1),nn.ReLU(),\n","                                  nn.ConvTranspose2d(32,1,4,2,1))\n","    def encode(self,x):\n","        h=self.features(x); return self.mu(h),self.lv(h)\n","    def decode_logits(self,z):return self.deconv(self.up(z).reshape(-1,64,7,7))\n","    def decode(self,z):return torch.sigmoid(self.decode_logits(z))\n","    def forward(self,x):\n","        mu,lv=self.encode(x)\n","        z=mu+torch.exp(0.5*lv)*torch.randn_like(mu)\n","        return self.decode_logits(z),mu,lv\n","\n","class DigitClassifier(nn.Module):\n","    def __init__(self):\n","        super().__init__()\n","        self.net=nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(1,16,3,padding=1),nn.ReLU(),nn.MaxPool2d(2),\n","             nn.Conv2d(16,32,3,padding=1),nn.ReLU(),nn.MaxPool2d(2),nn.Flatten(),\n","             nn.Linear(32*7*7,128),nn.ReLU(),nn.Linear(128,10))\n","    def forward(self,x):return self.net(x)\n","\n","SOBEL_X=torch.tensor([[-1.,0,1],[-2,0,2],[-1,0,1]]).view(1,1,3,3)/8\n","SOBEL_Y=torch.tensor([[-1.,-2,-1],[0,0,0],[1,2,1]]).view(1,1,3,3)/8\n","\n","def sobel(x):\n","    # 边界使用复制填充，减少黑色边缘的零填充伪影；保持反向传播。\n","    x=F.pad(x,(1,1,1,1),mode='replicate')\n","    return F.conv2d(x,SOBEL_X.to(x.device)),F.conv2d(x,SOBEL_Y.to(x.device))\n","\n","def edge_l1(a,b):\n","    ax,ay=sobel(a); bx,by=sobel(b)\n","    return 0.5*(F.l1_loss(ax,bx)+F.l1_loss(ay,by))\n","\n","def loss_terms(logits,x,mu,lv,edge_weight):\n","    recon=torch.sigmoid(logits)\n","    mse=F.mse_loss(recon,x)\n","    ed=edge_l1(recon,x)\n","    kl=(0.5*(mu.square()+lv.exp()-1-lv)).sum(1).mean()\n","    total=mse+edge_weight*ed+BETA*kl\n","    return total,mse,ed,kl\n","\n","CONFIGS=[\n"," {'name':'conv_mse_z4','d':4,'edge_weight':0.,'source_name':'conv_mse'},\n"," {'name':'conv_mse_z8','d':8,'edge_weight':0.,'source_name':None},\n"," {'name':'conv_mse_edge_z4','d':4,'edge_weight':EDGE_WEIGHT,'source_name':None},\n","]\n","# 如果可复用以前的 BCE 权重，则只作诊断参考，不参与“仅改维度/边缘损失”的因果比较。\n","OPTIONAL_BCE={'name':'conv_bce_reference_z4','d':4,'edge_weight':None,'source_name':'conv_bce'}\n","for cfg in CONFIGS:\n","    m=ConvVAE(cfg['d']).to(device)\n","    logits,mu,lv=m(torch.rand(2,1,28,28,device=device))\n","    assert logits.shape==(2,1,28,28) and mu.shape==(2,cfg['d'])\n","    (loss_terms(logits,torch.rand(2,1,28,28,device=device),mu,lv,cfg['edge_weight'])[0]).backward()\n","    print(cfg['name'],'parameters',sum(p.numel() for p in m.parameters()))\n","    del m"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"18f482ef","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002774,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.553877+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.551103+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 3. 寻找已有 40 轮权重（可选）并严格核验配置\n","Kaggle 的不同 Notebook 不共享 `/kaggle/working/`。如未把旧输出挂载为 Input，本 Notebook **自然找不到旧文件**，会自动新训；不要把 `conv_bce` 的权重误用作 MSE 基准。寻找旧权重时会读取内部 config，而不是靠文件名猜测。为避免自动读取不可信文件，额外搜索只扫描 Kaggle Input 的 `.pt`。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":4,"id":"d6b595a5","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.56093Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.560474Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.458307Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.457399Z"},"papermill":{"duration":2.903848,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.460404+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:45.556556+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["def cpu_tree(obj):\n","    if isinstance(obj,torch.Tensor):return obj.detach().cpu().clone()\n","    if isinstance(obj,dict):return {k:cpu_tree(v) for k,v in obj.items()}\n","    if isinstance(obj,list):return [cpu_tree(v) for v in obj]\n","    if isinstance(obj,tuple):return tuple(cpu_tree(v) for v in obj)\n","    return obj\n","\n","# 用户也可在此列表增加自己已经核对过的文件路径；默认先查旧输出目录，再查 Kaggle Input。\n","EXTRA_CHECKPOINT_PATHS=[]\n","OLD_EXPERIMENT=WORK/'hw2_results'/'vae_sharpness_v1'/'experiments'\n","\n","# 用户可以直接把可选的权重 ZIP 上传成 Kaggle Dataset，无需自己解压。\n","# 严格白名单解压3个已约定文件，防止通用 zip 路径穿越或无关文件被当成权重。\n","IMPORTED=ROOT/'imported_old_checkpoints'\n","def extract_optional_weight_bundle():\n","    k=Path('/kaggle/input')\n","    if not k.is_dir():return\n","    bundles=list(k.rglob('VAE_Three_Stage_Pretrained_Weights.zip'))\n","    allowed={\n","        'optional_existing_checkpoints/conv_mse/checkpoint_epoch_40.pt',\n","        'optional_existing_checkpoints/conv_bce/checkpoint_epoch_40.pt',\n","        'optional_existing_checkpoints/reference_classifier.pt'\n","    }\n","    for bundle in bundles:\n","        try:\n","            with zipfile.ZipFile(bundle) as zf:\n","                for n in zf.namelist():\n","                    if n not in allowed:continue\n","                    target=IMPORTED/Path(n).relative_to('optional_existing_checkpoints')\n","                    target.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\n","                    if not target.exists():\n","                        with zf.open(n) as source,target.open('wb') as dest:shutil.copyfileobj(source,dest)\n","            print('已从 Kaggle Input 读取可选旧权重包:',bundle.name)\n","        except Exception as exc:\n","            print('跳过损坏或不匹配的旧权重 ZIP:',bundle.name,type(exc).__name__)\n","extract_optional_weight_bundle()\n","\n","def candidate_old_checkpoints():\n","    paths=[OLD_EXPERIMENT/'conv_mse'/'checkpoint_epoch_40.pt',\n","           OLD_EXPERIMENT/'conv_bce'/'checkpoint_epoch_40.pt',\n","           IMPORTED/'conv_mse'/'checkpoint_epoch_40.pt',\n","           IMPORTED/'conv_bce'/'checkpoint_epoch_40.pt']\n","    paths.extend(Path(p) for p in EXTRA_CHECKPOINT_PATHS)\n","    kaggle_in=Path('/kaggle/input')\n","    if kaggle_in.is_dir():\n","        paths.extend(kaggle_in.rglob('checkpoint_epoch_40*.pt'))\n","    return list(dict.fromkeys(p for p in paths if p.is_file()))\n","\n","# weights_only=False 只读取自己的 Kaggle 输出或自己明确上传/授权的可信 pt；PyTorch pickle 不应加载陌生来源。\n","def trusted_load(path):return torch.load(path,map_location='cpu',weights_only=False)\n","\n","def matching_legacy_state(config_name):\n","    if FAST_DEV_RUN: return None\n","    if not REUSE_PRIOR_WEIGHTS:return None\n","    for path in candidate_old_checkpoints():\n","        try:\n","            obj=trusted_load(path)\n","            c=obj.get('config',{})\n","            ok=(c.get('name')==config_name and c.get('family')=='conv' and\n","                c.get('latent_dim')==4 and c.get('seed')==SEED and\n","                c.get('beta')==BETA and int(obj.get('epoch',-1))==40 and\n","                c.get('train_count')==55000 and c.get('val_count')==5000 and\n","                c.get('batch_size')==256 and abs(c.get('learning_rate',0)-LR)<1e-12)\n","            if ok:\n","                print('找到已核验的旧模型:', config_name, path)\n","                return obj, str(path)\n","        except Exception as e:\n","            print('跳过不匹配/不可读的历史检查点:',path.name,type(e).__name__)\n","    return None"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"d53ecaa8","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002692,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.466067+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.463375+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 4. 检查点恢复、训练与复用\n","标准实验仅在确实没有可复用的旧权重时从 Epoch 1 开始训练。训练函数可以从自己的最新检查点续训，避免 Kaggle 会话中断后重复训练。所有 CUDA 随机状态恢复为 CPU ByteTensor，修复此前出现的 RNG 类型错误。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":5,"id":"98c770c5","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.473253Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.472776Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.491584Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.491004Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.024511,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.493253+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.468742+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["def run_config(cfg):\n","    return {'name':cfg['name'],'latent_dim':cfg['d'],'edge_weight':cfg['edge_weight'],\n","            'beta':BETA,'seed':SEED,'lr':LR,'batch_size':BATCH_SIZE,\n","            'epochs':EPOCHS,'train_count':len(train_set),'val_count':len(val_set),\n","            'split_seed':2026,'loss_kind':'mse'}\n","\n","def save_checkpoint(path,model,opt,epoch,history,cfg):\n","    payload={'model':cpu_tree(model.state_dict()),'optimizer':cpu_tree(opt.state_dict()),\n","             'epoch':epoch,'history':history,'config':run_config(cfg),\n","             'rng_torch':torch.get_rng_state().cpu(),\n","             'rng_cuda':[t.cpu() for t in torch.cuda.get_rng_state_all()] if torch.cuda.is_available() else [],\n","             'rng_numpy':np.random.get_state(),'rng_python':random.getstate()}\n","    tmp=path.with_suffix('.tmp');torch.save(payload,tmp);tmp.replace(path)\n","    if epoch in (20,EPOCHS):torch.save(payload,path.parent/f'checkpoint_epoch_{epoch}.pt')\n","\n","def resume_checkpoint(path,model,opt,cfg):\n","    ck=trusted_load(path)\n","    c=ck.get('config',{}); expected=run_config(cfg)\n","    keys=['name','latent_dim','edge_weight','beta','seed','lr','batch_size','train_count','val_count','split_seed','loss_kind']\n","    if any(c.get(k)!=expected[k] for k in keys):\n","        raise RuntimeError(f'当前实验 {cfg[\"name\"]} 的检查点配置不一致：{path}；请另选输出目录。')\n","    model.load_state_dict(ck['model']);opt.load_state_dict(ck['optimizer'])\n","    torch.set_rng_state(ck['rng_torch'].cpu().to(torch.uint8))\n","    np.random.set_state(ck['rng_numpy']); random.setstate(ck['rng_python'])\n","    states=ck.get('rng_cuda',[])\n","    if device.type=='cuda' and len(states)==torch.cuda.device_count():\n","        torch.cuda.set_rng_state_all([x.cpu().to(torch.uint8).contiguous() for x in states])\n","    return int(ck['epoch']),list(ck['history'])\n","\n","def write_csv(path,rows,columns=None):\n","    rows=list(rows)\n","    if columns is None: columns=list(rows[0]) if rows else ['empty']\n","    with path.open('w',newline='',encoding='utf-8-sig') as f:\n","        writer=csv.DictWriter(f,fieldnames=columns,extrasaction='ignore');writer.writeheader();writer.writerows(rows)\n","\n","def train_or_load(cfg):\n","    run_dir=MODELS/cfg['name'];run_dir.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\n","    seed_all(SEED)\n","    model=ConvVAE(cfg['d']).to(device)\n","    optimizer=torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(),lr=LR)\n","    latest=run_dir/'checkpoint_latest.pt';history=[];start=0\n","    if latest.exists():\n","        start,history=resume_checkpoint(latest,model,optimizer,cfg)\n","        if start>EPOCHS:raise RuntimeError('检查点训练轮次超过目标轮次，不能冒充已完成模型。')\n","        print(cfg['name'],'复用自己的检查点 epoch',start)\n","    elif cfg['source_name'] and (legacy:=matching_legacy_state(cfg['source_name'])) is not None:\n","        src,where=legacy\n","        model.load_state_dict(src['model']);start=40;history=list(src.get('history',[]))\n","        info={'source':where,'verified_name':cfg['source_name'],'verified_epoch':40}\n","        (run_dir/'imported_legacy_checkpoint.json').write_text(json.dumps(info,indent=2),encoding='utf-8')\n","        save_checkpoint(latest,model,optimizer,start,history,cfg)\n","    if not RUN_FULL and start<EPOCHS:\n","        raise RuntimeError(f'RUN_FULL=False，但 {cfg[\"name\"]} 没有完整训练权重。')\n","    for epoch in range(start+1,EPOCHS+1):\n","        model.train();sse=0.;edges=0.;kls=0.;n=0\n","        for x,_ in make_train_loader(epoch):\n","            x=x.to(device);logits,mu,lv=model(x)\n","            total,mse,ed,kl=loss_terms(logits,x,mu,lv,cfg['edge_weight'])\n","            optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True);total.backward();optimizer.step()\n","            n+=len(x);sse+=float(mse.item())*len(x);edges+=float(ed.item())*len(x);kls+=float(kl.item())*len(x)\n","        row={'epoch':epoch,'train_mse':sse/n,'train_edge_l1':edges/n,'train_kl':kls/n,\n","             'train_total':sse/n+cfg['edge_weight']*edges/n+BETA*kls/n}\n","        history.append(row)\n","        if epoch==1 or epoch%5==0 or epoch==EPOCHS:\n","            print(cfg['name'],f'epoch {epoch}/{EPOCHS}',f'MSE={row[\"train_mse\"]:.5f}',f'edge={row[\"train_edge_l1\"]:.5f}',f'KL={row[\"train_kl\"]:.3f}')\n","        if epoch%5==0 or epoch==EPOCHS:save_checkpoint(latest,model,optimizer,epoch,history,cfg)\n","    if history:write_csv(run_dir/'training_history.csv',history,list(history[0]))\n","    model.eval()\n","    return model"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"8e4f8a5b","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002373,"end_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.498248+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.495875+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 5. 冻结的 MNIST 分类器\n","可以从旧实验中自动复用兼容的权重；若 Kaggle 无旧文件，会只在训练子集训练一份新的分类器，并用验证集检验其真实图像识别能力。若验证准确率低于95%，本 Notebook **不将重建类别准确率作为可靠结论**。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"id":"445dd145","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.50518Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-02T15:46:48.504409Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-02T15:46:51.546679Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-02T15: